01:11:29.360 --> 01:11:32.130
Video Intelligence API is really
indicative of what Google Cloud

01:11:32.130 --> 01:11:34.870
Platform is trying
to do, in general.

01:11:34.870 --> 01:11:36.710
Video Intelligence
API is the result

01:11:36.710 --> 01:11:41.390
of intense investments
in AI and data science

01:11:41.390 --> 01:11:44.330
and lots of research,
inside of Google,

01:11:44.330 --> 01:11:47.760
that makes its way into
your hands as a customer,

01:11:47.760 --> 01:11:51.000
but also through a very, very
