01:11:58.700 --> 01:12:01.880
cases and to have your
applications actually interact

01:12:01.880 --> 01:12:04.580
with the world in the
same way that humans do.

01:12:04.580 --> 01:12:09.320
This is fascinating, right, this
new reality that we live in.

01:12:09.320 --> 01:12:12.320
And so to kind of wrap up,
I'd like to kind of give you

01:12:12.320 --> 01:12:14.650
