01:12:14.650 --> 01:12:18.140
Today, you must embrace data.

01:12:18.140 --> 01:12:24.050
You must embrace the fact that
data drives all decision making

01:12:24.050 --> 01:12:25.180
in the world.

01:12:25.180 --> 01:12:28.610
And so, in order to
really propel yourself

01:12:28.610 --> 01:12:30.200
and to innovate
further, you need

01:12:30.200 --> 01:12:33.230
take care of all the layers of
data management, all the way

01:12:33.230 --> 01:12:36.590
from the application database,
to the analytics database,

01:12:36.590 --> 01:12:39.440
and then, potentially, even
to AI machine learning.

01:12:39.440 --> 01:12:40.940
And with that, I'd
