01:13:26.670 --> 01:13:29.550
The problem is-- and here's
something we really have

01:13:29.550 --> 01:13:31.230
to pause on for a minute--

01:13:31.230 --> 01:13:34.530
that we're all trying to
drive these transformation

01:13:34.530 --> 01:13:38.130
outcomes, new methods, new
ways to approach problems,

01:13:38.130 --> 01:13:40.890
new markets, new customer
solutions, new ways

01:13:40.890 --> 01:13:43.950
to interact with partners and
the ecosystem with which we

01:13:43.950 --> 01:13:45.090
work.

01:13:45.090 --> 01:13:46.260
That's great.

01:13:46.260 --> 01:13:47.970
That comes from what?

01:13:47.970 --> 01:13:52.290
That innovation is really a
result of transformative ideas

01:13:52.290 --> 01:13:54.660
that we create and think
about in the workplace

01:13:54.660 --> 01:13:56.880
with these same partners.

01:13:56.880 --> 01:14:00.450
Those transformative ideas
are built on creativity.

01:14:00.450 --> 01:14:03.120
Creativity is the
crucible which allows

01:14:03.120 --> 01:14:06.790
us to come up with new ideas,
which lead to transformation.

01:14:06.790 --> 01:14:08.790
But the question I have
for you, as an audience,

01:14:08.790 --> 01:14:12.570
today, as you sit there,
is what is the catalyst

01:14:12.570 --> 01:14:15.540
for that creative process?

01:14:15.540 --> 01:14:17.970
What is it that gets people
to be able to come up

01:14:17.970 --> 01:14:19.860
with new ideas
and actually think

01:14:19.860 --> 01:14:21.610
of a different approach,
a different way,

01:14:21.610 --> 01:14:25.800
a different method to be able to
affect an outcome that does it?

01:14:25.800 --> 01:14:29.340
I submit to you that
that is engagement.

01:14:29.340 --> 01:14:32.850
When two or more people get
together, they lock themselves

01:14:32.850 --> 01:14:34.380
in a room, in a
conference place,

01:14:34.380 --> 01:14:37.780
or they're in a Google Doc
working together, in realtime,

01:14:37.780 --> 01:14:40.200
they're starting to create,
think, and reason together.

01:14:40.200 --> 01:14:43.070
And what happens-- and you
all have this experience--

01:14:43.070 --> 01:14:48.330
is you begin to synthesize new
ideas from existing components,

01:14:48.330 --> 01:14:50.460
existing facts, and
your observations

01:14:50.460 --> 01:14:52.900
about the world around you.

01:14:52.900 --> 01:14:55.770
And that's what we are
doing in Google Cloud

01:14:55.770 --> 01:14:57.000
and our collaboration suite.

01:14:57.000 --> 01:15:02.040
We've had great success
introducing G Suite

01:15:02.040 --> 01:15:03.340
just around 10 years ago.

01:15:03.340 --> 01:15:07.800
I joined Google around
2007, so I'm coming up

01:15:07.800 --> 01:15:09.390
on my 10-year anniversary.

01:15:09.390 --> 01:15:13.110
And I began the Google journey
in the collaboration space.

01:15:13.110 --> 01:15:15.570
And when Google brings
a new product to market,

01:15:15.570 --> 01:15:20.440
our thinking is, how do we
impact over a billion people?

01:15:20.440 --> 01:15:23.220
How do we solve problems that
no one else is addressing?

01:15:23.220 --> 01:15:26.130
And how do we bring something
that is unique to the flavor

01:15:26.130 --> 01:15:27.720
that only Google can do?

01:15:27.720 --> 01:15:29.910
And this is what we
believe we have delivered

01:15:29.910 --> 01:15:33.220
in the context of G Suite.

01:15:33.220 --> 01:15:34.360
There's a problem, though.

01:15:34.360 --> 01:15:39.100
We have a great suite
of capabilities,

01:15:39.100 --> 01:15:42.550
from realtime collaboration,
to meetings, to Google Drive,

01:15:42.550 --> 01:15:44.329
to all these great
products that service

01:15:44.329 --> 01:15:46.870
that collaborative effort and
allow you to connect and create

01:15:46.870 --> 01:15:48.430
together.

01:15:48.430 --> 01:15:52.340
But what we've recognized
is that that's not enough.

01:15:52.340 --> 01:15:54.610
It's not enough to
just be able to create

01:15:54.610 --> 01:15:57.040
and to be able to work
together in realtime.

01:15:57.040 --> 01:15:59.860
We have to take the
power of machine learning

01:15:59.860 --> 01:16:02.260
and apply it to
everything we're doing.

01:16:02.260 --> 01:16:04.780
Because what's happening
in the workplace today

01:16:04.780 --> 01:16:08.560
is there are obstacles to my
creating the next big idea.

01:16:08.560 --> 01:16:12.070
And those obstacles are, number
one, I don't have enough time.

01:16:12.070 --> 01:16:15.910
I've got to create
space for creativity.

01:16:15.910 --> 01:16:19.210
I've got to have a set of tools
that will optimize my day,

01:16:19.210 --> 01:16:22.090
optimize the way I work, find
the things I need when I need

01:16:22.090 --> 01:16:25.420
them, so that I can create
more room for creativity

01:16:25.420 --> 01:16:27.820
and more room for collaboration.

01:16:27.820 --> 01:16:31.420
The second thing that I have to
do is I have to lift my game.

01:16:31.420 --> 01:16:34.120
I have to be able to work
smarter and work more

01:16:34.120 --> 01:16:35.020
intelligently.

01:16:35.020 --> 01:16:37.630
And I have to do so using
best practices of those that

01:16:37.630 --> 01:16:39.910
are around me, experts
within the field,

01:16:39.910 --> 01:16:42.250
in my sphere of
influence and outside

01:16:42.250 --> 01:16:43.814
of my sphere of influence.

01:16:43.814 --> 01:16:45.730
So I've got to have
intelligent solutions that

01:16:45.730 --> 01:16:47.360
allow me to do that.

01:16:47.360 --> 01:16:48.940
The third thing
is the tools have

01:16:48.940 --> 01:16:53.200
to be built, fundamentally,
for teams not for individuals.

01:16:53.200 --> 01:16:54.850
We need to have
tools that actually

01:16:54.850 --> 01:16:57.910
get us to engage, to get
that catalyst working,

01:16:57.910 --> 01:17:02.110
to create, to transform, and
then reap the rewards of that.

01:17:02.110 --> 01:17:05.350
And then, finally, the fourth
point which is important

01:17:05.350 --> 01:17:06.820
is that I've got
to have tools that

01:17:06.820 --> 01:17:09.760
integrate with the back office,
integrate with the workflow,

01:17:09.760 --> 01:17:11.680
and integrate with
the other components

01:17:11.680 --> 01:17:14.830
that I use on a daily basis,
like the ERP system and CRM

01:17:14.830 --> 01:17:16.100
system.

01:17:16.100 --> 01:17:19.150
So what I want to do, over
the next couple of minutes,

01:17:19.150 --> 01:17:21.790
is I want to give you a
glimpse into some of the things

01:17:21.790 --> 01:17:24.970
that we're doing in Google
to help us solve those four

01:17:24.970 --> 01:17:28.390
problems, that will allow us to
arrive at the transformations

01:17:28.390 --> 01:17:32.370
we need and demand
in today's world.

01:17:32.370 --> 01:17:36.130
Let's start a little bit
with artificial intelligence.

01:17:36.130 --> 01:17:38.500
As you know, Google's
been working in this field

01:17:38.500 --> 01:17:39.460
for a long, long time.

01:17:39.460 --> 01:17:41.650
And many of have
experienced the benefit

01:17:41.650 --> 01:17:45.970
of type-ahead, which is built
on an AI algorithm that examines

01:17:45.970 --> 01:17:48.820
all of the different words
that people are typing in,

01:17:48.820 --> 01:17:51.610
in different languages, to
provide useful suggestions

01:17:51.610 --> 01:17:53.710
to be able to allow you
to find information.

01:17:53.710 --> 01:17:56.590
That's a great example
of time savings.

01:17:56.590 --> 01:17:59.830
When you use type-ahead,
as an example,

01:17:59.830 --> 01:18:02.110
you're finding results faster.

01:18:02.110 --> 01:18:03.670
You're finding more
relevant results.

01:18:03.670 --> 01:18:06.010
And you're getting
to the information

01:18:06.010 --> 01:18:07.900
you need quickly to get that.

01:18:07.900 --> 01:18:10.730
But that can be integrated
into everything we do.

01:18:10.730 --> 01:18:12.850
So let's take a look
at what we're doing

01:18:12.850 --> 01:18:14.860
in artificial intelligence.

01:18:14.860 --> 01:18:18.130
We're working on systems,
integrated into the G Suite

01:18:18.130 --> 01:18:20.500
product, that will allow
you to recover lost time,

01:18:20.500 --> 01:18:24.760
improve your team effectiveness,
and uncover big ideas.

01:18:24.760 --> 01:18:27.760
And let's begin with Drive.

01:18:27.760 --> 01:18:30.310
So the first innovation that
I want to talk to you about

