01:33:00.750 --> 01:33:04.950
To me, this is absolutely,
absolutely exciting.

01:33:04.950 --> 01:33:06.720
Four years ago, I
started in Google.

01:33:06.720 --> 01:33:08.280
And it went like this.

01:33:08.280 --> 01:33:11.790
Hey, Andre, just, here, you have
the Benelux, the Nordics, north

01:33:11.790 --> 01:33:14.730
of Europe, and just go
and build the business

01:33:14.730 --> 01:33:16.090
for Cloud Platform.

01:33:16.090 --> 01:33:17.220
So that's where I started.

01:33:17.220 --> 01:33:19.470
And it was absolutely
an amazing journey.

01:33:19.470 --> 01:33:22.860
So many, many known
faces in the public.

01:33:22.860 --> 01:33:25.230
Working with Philips
